    },
    "Keep recording" : {
      "comment" : "Meeting suggestion HUD button that keeps the recording going",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep recording"
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nagrywaj dalej"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lintel only checks which app is using the microphone, never what it hears. It knows Zoom, Teams, Slack, FaceTime, Webex and Discord, and asks before recording; it never starts by itself. A browser counts only if you add it above, because a web page using the microphone can be a false alarm. Only these lists and, for a meeting you start from a suggestion, the app's ID are stored. Apps built on Safari's engine (WebKit helpers) may not be detected, and the pill cannot be operated from the keyboard; VoiceOver reads it and can press its buttons." : {
      "comment" : "Meetings settings footer under the meeting suggestions",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lintel only checks which app is using the microphone, never what it hears. It knows Zoom, Teams, Slack, FaceTime, Webex and Discord, and asks before recording; it never starts by itself. A browser counts only if you add it above, because a web page using the microphone can be a false alarm. Only these lists and, for a meeting you start from a suggestion, the app's ID are stored. Apps built on Safari's engine (WebKit helpers) may not be detected, and the pill cannot be operated from the keyboard; VoiceOver reads it and can press its buttons."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lintel sprawdza tylko, która aplikacja używa mikrofonu, nigdy co słyszy. Zna Zoom, Teams, Slack, FaceTime, Webex i Discord i pyta, zanim zacznie nagrywać; sam nigdy nie zaczyna. Przeglądarka liczy się tylko, jeśli dodasz ją powyżej, bo strona używająca mikrofonu może dać fałszywy alarm. Zapisywane są tylko te listy oraz, dla spotkania rozpoczętego z podpowiedzi, identyfikator aplikacji. Aplikacje oparte na silniku Safari (procesy pomocnicze WebKit) mogą nie zostać wykryte, a podpowiedzi nie da się obsłużyć z klawiatury; VoiceOver ją odczytuje i pozwala nacisnąć jej przyciski."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lintel cannot confirm that detection works on this Mac: no app has reported microphone use yet." : {
      "comment" : "Meetings settings: the process audio API listens but no process has answered",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lintel cannot confirm that detection works on this Mac: no app has reported microphone use yet."
